Public sources of the engine's hardware details

- The HMX instructions (src/hmx_k2.S) are of the forms that llama.cpp's ggml-hexagon backend uses
  (ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/hmx-utils.h, MIT License). src/hmx_words.S holds their encodings. The build needs no
  Hexagon SDK.
- The DMA descriptor format follows llama.cpp's ggml-hexagon/htp/dma-queue.h (MIT). The DSP power request, compute
  resource and thread calls (src/kdsp.h) are used with the same values as in llama.cpp's ggml-hexagon/htp (MIT).
- The FastRPC values (src/kremote.h) are those of qualcomm/fastrpc (inc/remote.h, inc/rpcmem.h, inc/AEEStdErr.h;
  BSD-3-Clause).

